/Notice (Copyright \(c\) 1985, 1987, 1989, 1990, 1997, 1998, 1999 Adobe Systems Incorporated.  All Rights Reserved.Helvetica is a trademark of Linotype-Hell AG and/or its subsidiaries.) readonly def
end def
